OL,3,GNEWSAMystery movie is 'fab for bringing
OL,4,Abuzz' to historic village
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is a tangible feeling of
OL,7,Fexcitement in Saltaire about the latest
OL,8,Fcinematic production to descend on the
OL,9,FVictorian model village.
OL,11,FThe Unesco World Heritage site, first
OL,12,Fcommissioned in 1851, is famous for its
OL,13,Fcobbled terraced streets and historic
OL,14,FGrade II* listed mill.
OL,16,FIn recent years it has been the
OL,17,Fbackdrop for a number of films,
OL,18,Fincluding Alan Bennett's The Choral
OL,19,Fstarring Ralph Fiennes and Jim
OL,20,FBroadbent in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
